# Halstead's 'Bugs' estimation (b) could introduce redundancy, as other Halstead metrics like difficulty (d), effort (e), and intelligence (i) already encapsulate details about the complexity and maintainability of the code. Including b risks collinearity.
df.drop(columns=['b'], inplace=True)
end

